00:01:36.235 --> 00:01:38.340
I've got a great kids

00:01:39.453 --> 00:01:40.286
and wife

00:01:40.286 --> 00:01:41.964
and we're really lucky,

00:01:41.964 --> 00:01:43.350
we've been okay.

